{"steam_appid":2273430,"steam_name":"BlazBlue Entropy Effect","trailer_hls":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2273430/1645862357/85ecd59152c945ecf35966b4d5c5ee8fe095321b/1779958510/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1779964053","trailer_thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257344775/e0f60fc47219320581a6e7d21226e297a6d1fbfa/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1779964053","screenshots":["https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2273430/7010b54ec865e58eb0ed1bffbf93dbd758b3710b/ss_7010b54ec865e58eb0ed1bffbf93dbd758b3710b.1920x1080.jpg?t=1781579464","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2273430/362000316a5eec9b3000d5d171d42bb786ec45d9/ss_362000316a5eec9b3000d5d171d42bb786ec45d9.1920x1080.jpg?t=1781579464","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2273430/eeb22a9aeea6f0be63ea98bcd716011d558f3d7a/ss_eeb22a9aeea6f0be63ea98bcd716011d558f3d7a.1920x1080.jpg?t=1781579464","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2273430/ss_8a670ff757f165907162508bd23b66315e2a4437.1920x1080.jpg?t=1781579464","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2273430/5a81cabaf5d22dd029c44f575220eade4316f652/ss_5a81cabaf5d22dd029c44f575220eade4316f652.1920x1080.jpg?t=1781579464"],"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Flashy Action Combat</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2273430/extras/f1cbf2beeed006d9618fb029c8a9ca54.poster.avif?t=1781579464\" width=650 height=364 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2273430/extras/f1cbf2beeed006d9618fb029c8a9ca54.webm?t=1781579464\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2273430/extras/f1cbf2beeed006d9618fb029c8a9ca54.mp4?t=1781579464\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Charismatic character designs with unique aesthetic styles and dramatic animations create an awesome combat experience.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Incredible Satisfying Gameplay</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2273430/extras/784de511dd6103e39187134a19263378.poster.avif?t=1781579464\" width=650 height=364 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2273430/extras/784de511dd6103e39187134a19263378.webm?t=1781579464\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2273430/extras/784de511dd6103e39187134a19263378.mp4?t=1781579464\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Smooth controls, infinite possibilities of combos and ultra-responsive combat feedback  create one of the best action experiences out there!  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Numerous Playstyles</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2273430/extras/d5b3277bac83bf3bb46fc772135d7cb7.poster.avif?t=1781579464\" width=650 height=366 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2273430/extras/d5b3277bac83bf3bb46fc772135d7cb7.webm?t=1781579464\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2273430/extras/d5b3277bac83bf3bb46fc772135d7cb7.mp4?t=1781579464\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >16 playable characters, each with distinctly unique combat styles and personalities to explore. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Hundreds of Moves for Customization</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2273430/extras/e64b91e694dc34c3bc38935d1054045b.poster.avif?t=1781579464\" width=650 height=366 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2273430/extras/e64b91e694dc34c3bc38935d1054045b.webm?t=1781579464\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2273430/extras/e64b91e694dc34c3bc38935d1054045b.mp4?t=1781579464\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are hundreds of moves for you to build around, plus countless elemental effects and legacy skills passed between characters. The possibilities are infinite. Time to make the best fighter of your own! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Iconic Crossovers, Fresh Thrills</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2273430/extras/0bf0d00032dc3ab72962c555912b3f5b.poster.avif?t=1781579464\" width=650 height=366 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2273430/extras/0bf0d00032dc3ab72962c555912b3f5b.webm?t=1781579464\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2273430/extras/0bf0d00032dc3ab72962c555912b3f5b.mp4?t=1781579464\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into free crossover content featuring two indie legends: ICEY and Dead Cells!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reunite ICEY with the Narrator and embark on a journey guided by his voice... or, you know, <i>just ignore him completely. :)</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Alternatively, embody The Prisoner and slash your way through a specially crafted Metroidvania-style zone, uncovering a brand-new original story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Please Note</i>:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All plotlines included in the collaboration content are completely unrelated to the original IP of the collaboration.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Please be aware that this game contains visual elements such as flashing screens that may trigger photosensitive epilepsy.</p></li></ul>","requirements_minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Nvidia GeForce GTX 950<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 18 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> Recommended display resolution: 1280 x 720; SSD</li></ul>","requirements_recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5+<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Nvidia GeForce GTX 1060+<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 18 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> Recommended display resolution: 2560 x 1440; SSD</li></ul>","genres":["Action","Adventure","Indie"],"developers":["91Act"],"publishers":["91Act","Astrolabe Games"],"release_date":"14 Feb, 2024","metacritic_score":83}